```ejs
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Password Changed Successfully</title>
</head>

<body style="
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  background-color: #f4f7fb;
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  color: #333333;
">

  <table
    width="100%"
    cellpadding="0"
    cellspacing="0"
    border="0"
    style="
      background-color: #f4f7fb;
      padding: 40px 15px;
    "
  >
    <tr>
      <td align="center">

        <table
          width="100%"
          cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0"
          border="0"
          style="
            max-width: 520px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
          "
        >

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td
              align="center"
              style="
                background-color: #16a34a;
                padding: 28px 20px;
              "
            >
              <div style="
                font-size: 42px;
                line-height: 1;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
              ">
                ✓
              </div>

              <h1 style="
                margin: 0;
                color: #ffffff;
                font-size: 24px;
                font-weight: 600;
              ">
                Password Changed
              </h1>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Content -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 35px 30px;">

              <p style="
                margin: 0 0 15px;
                font-size: 16px;
                line-height: 1.6;
              ">
                Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,
              </p>

              <p style="
                margin: 0 0 20px;
                font-size: 15px;
                line-height: 1.7;
                color: #555555;
              ">
                Your password has been changed successfully.
                You can now use your new password to sign in to your account.
              </p>

              <!-- Success Message -->
              <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                border="0"
                style="
                  background-color: #f0fdf4;
                  border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
                  border-radius: 8px;
                  margin: 25px 0;
                "
              >
                <tr>
                  <td style="
                    padding: 18px;
                    text-align: center;
                  ">
                    <p style="
                      margin: 0;
                      color: #15803d;
                      font-size: 15px;
                      font-weight: 600;
                    ">
                      ✓ Your password was updated successfully.
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 1.7;
                color: #777777;
              ">
                If you made this change, no further action is required.
              </p>

              <p style="
                margin: 15px 0 0;
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 1.7;
                color: #777777;
              ">
                If you did not change your password, please contact
                your administrator immediately and secure your account.
              </p>

              <hr style="
                border: 0;
                border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                margin: 30px 0;
              />

              <p style="
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 13px;
                line-height: 1.6;
                color: #999999;
                text-align: center;
              ">
                For your security, never share your password with anyone.
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td
              align="center"
              style="
                background-color: #f8fafc;
                padding: 20px;
                border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
              "
            >
              <p style="
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #999999;
              ">
                This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
```
